7. Write AI_Incident_Severity_Matrix.md with sections: 1) Dimensions, 2) Per-Failure-Class Thresholds, 3) Service-Credit Mapping, 4) EU AI Act Art. 73 Mapping, 5) Elevation / De-escalation Rules, 6) Cross-Refs.

